523
00:29:14.680 --> 00:29:16.307
ya tuan ?

524
00:29:17.616 --> 00:29:20.380
Itulah di mana ia akan pergi... dan awan itu.

525
00:29:20.419 --> 00:29:21.886
Awan apa itu?

526
00:29:21.921 --> 00:29:23.650
Saya berada di Bajor.

527
00:29:23.689 --> 00:29:25.122
B’hala telah dibangun kembali.

528
00:29:25.157 --> 00:29:27.921
Orang-orang di jalanan sedang merayakan

529
